OL,3,GNEWSAHeart failure survivor's mum backs
OL,4,AChristmas appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs Christmas approached, Louise worried
OL,7,Fthat her children would miss out on the
OL,8,Ftraditions and excitement but on 25
OL,9,FDecember the family woke to an
OL,10,Funexpected surprise.
OL,12,F"We woke up and there were sacks of
OL,13,Fpresents... It was one less thing to
OL,14,Fworry about at a time when we were
OL,15,Fcarrying so much," she said.
